# Device Mute Configuration File
# Format: "deviceName", "projectName", "YYYY-MM-DD"
# The device will be muted (no notifications sent) until the end of the specified date
# After that date, notifications will resume automatically
#
# Example:
# "APF-02 Meter", "Nestle Vital Proteins", "2026-01-18"
#
# This means "APF-02 Meter" in project "Nestle Vital Proteins" will be muted until 2026-01-18 23:59:59
# Notifications will resume on 2026-01-19
#
# Lines starting with # or ; are comments and will be ignored
# Empty lines are ignored

"APF-02 Meter", "Nestle Vital Proteins", "2026-01-18"
